# UI craft

Follow `.cursor/skills/douyin-ui-craft/SKILL.md` when changing these files.

- One primary CTA per screen/card. Ghost/danger recede.
- Type: page `text-2xl font-semibold`; card title `text-[15px] font-medium`; meta `tnum text-xs text-fg-2`.
- Overlays must use `@/components/Modal`. No new `fixed inset-0` copies.
- Accent on primary/active only. Cyan for links only.
- Reuse `PageHeader`, `EmptyState`, `ErrorBanner`, `Toast`, `Card`, `Button`.
- Do not change API contracts in a visual pass.

```tsx
// ❌ equal-weight actions
<Button variant="ghost">编辑</Button>
<Button variant="ghost">生成文案</Button>
<Button variant="danger">删除</Button>

// ✅ one primary
<Link href={gen}><Button>生成文案</Button></Link>
<Link href={edit}><Button variant="ghost">编辑</Button></Link>
```
